    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>* The Demo features the very first chapter of 'Man of Nollyn'.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lone game developer thought, sipping his cold coffee:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;What if I made a classic noir detective game, but with some twists? A little jazz in the background. A few bad jokes. Maybe throw in some characters with actual feelings, just for fun. Have them go through some real life shit. How about that?\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And so, <i>Man of Nollyn</i> was born.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523520/extras/612a1105301cfa194618b9d363478b21.avif?t=1750373542\" data-has-big width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all detectives wear fedoras and trench coats. <i>Man of Nollyn\u00a0</i>is the story of young adults who grew up too fast, solving brutal crimes, and making mistakes along the way. You'll be playing as Vin Virosa, a street-borne private eye with a foul mouth and a dark past. Your clients are Katherine and Chloe, two ambitious police officers looking to prove themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523520/extras/0bc13703445cbe78436c2d577a53df9d.avif?t=1750373542\" data-has-big width=800 height=374 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique investigation mechanisms: Bribery &amp; Intimidation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stuck on something? Need a hint? In <i>Man of Nollyn</i>, you don't get that by asking nicely. Bribe suspects with money, or even shove a gun in their face to discover the truth. Not the noblest act, but hey. What\u2019s the worst that could happen?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523520/extras/eb2e5deb7cdabcf92175434ce82a614a.avif?t=1750373542\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A side-scrolling noir-style detective game with sharp wit and biting satire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bribe suspects or intimidate them into spilling their secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short answer questions. A real detective wouldn\u2019t just guess, right?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich jazz soundtrack. Really makes you feel like an actual genius.</p></li></ul>",
