uth. Not the noblest act, but hey. What\u2019s the worst that could happen?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523520/extras/eb2e5deb7cdabcf92175434ce82a614a.avif?t=1750373542\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A side-scrolling noir-style detective game with sharp wit and biting satire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bribe suspects or intimidate them into spilling their secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short answer questions. A real detective wouldn\u2019t just guess, right?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich jazz soundtrack. Really makes you feel like an actual genius.</p></li></ul>",
